1. Definitions.

   (a) "Specification" means the AFSP specification, including its schemas,
       worked examples and example code, as published in this repository or
       at agenticfinanceprotocol.org.

   (b) "AFSP Governing Body" means Primitive, as founding author and interim
       protocol administrator, until governance of AFSP transfers to the AFSP
       Foundation, and the AFSP Foundation after that transfer.

2. Reproduction. Anyone may read, copy, reproduce and distribute the
